  <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);">This is still under construction — not running yet. Metro timelines have moved before and can move again, so check <a href="https://chennaimetrorail.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">chennaimetrorail.org</a> for the latest, rather than banking on a fixed date.</p>

